(g)
amount of income declared in the return;
(h)
amount of tax payable;
(i)
amount of tax paid;
(j)
the amount disbursable to him under sub-paragraph (1) of paragraph 9 of this Scheme for any eligible assessment year
mentioned therein;
(k)
the fee charged and received by him under sub-paragraph (2) of paragraph 9 of this Scheme;
(vii)
furnish a statement of particulars mentioned in item (vi) for every month on or before the seventh day of the immediately
following month to the Resource Centre.
